@baseUrl = http://localhost:5102
@adminKey = dev-admin-key
# Sign the exact scalar fields with PaymentSim.Signing before sending gateway requests.
# Obtain a fresh Unix timestamp and nonce for EVERY request, including idempotent retries.
@timestamp = 0
@nonce = replace-with-fresh-nonce
@sign = replace-with-computed-signature

### Pay-in; choose normal, delay:3,duplicate:2, out-of-order, bad-signature, no-callback or decline
POST {{baseUrl}}/gateway/payin
Content-Type: application/json

{"merchantId":"M1001","merchantOrderNo":"demo-payin-1","amount":"12.50","currency":"USD","notifyUrl":"http://localhost:5112/payments/notify","scenario":"bad-signature","timestamp":"{{timestamp}}","nonce":"{{nonce}}","sign":"{{sign}}"}

### Payout
POST {{baseUrl}}/gateway/payout
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

merchantId=M1001&merchantOrderNo=demo-payout-1&amount=10.00&currency=USD&notifyUrl=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A5112%2Fpayments%2Fnotify&bankCode=DEMO&accountNo=00001234&accountName=Sample%20Person&timestamp={{timestamp}}&nonce={{nonce}}&sign={{sign}}

### Signed query
POST {{baseUrl}}/gateway/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"merchantId":"M1001","merchantOrderNo":"demo-payin-1","timestamp":"{{timestamp}}","nonce":"{{nonce}}","sign":"{{sign}}"}

### Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/api/orders
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Delivery journal
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/api/callbacks?outcome=Rejected
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Top up synthetic funds
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/api/merchants/M1001/balance
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currency":"USD","amount":100}

### Create and sign through the merchant sample
POST http://localhost:5112/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":12.50,"currency":"USD","scenario":"delay:3,duplicate:2"}

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
